.poseStage img{display:block;max-width:100%;border-radius:12px}.poseStage canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}.pill{display:inline-block;background:#edf3ee;padding:5px 9px;border-radius:999px;margin:4px}.jointgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:10px}.joint{border:1px solid #dbe2dc;border-radius:10px;padding:9px}.status{font-size:13px;color:#667168;margin-top:8px}.gate{border-left:4px solid #9d5c52;padding-left:12px}.ok{border-left-color:#3c7a55}.tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.tabs a{color:#173d2c}.hiddenInput{display:none}.m5-tags{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px}.m5-tags span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d5ddd6;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 9px}.m5-actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px}.m5-action{border:1px solid #d9e2db;border-radius:13px;padding:13px;background:#fbfcfb}.m5-action h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:17px}.m5-action p{margin:5px 0;line-height:1.5}@media(max-width:820px){.grid,.m5-actions{grid-template-columns:1fr}.jointgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.atlas{height:560px}.intent{flex-direction:column}}</style></head><body><main class=\"wrap\"><section class=\"card\">\n<div class=\"status\">V0.1 单一产品入口｜Issue #2 验收状态：M1 COMPLETED · M2 COMPLETED · M3 COMPLETED · M4 COMPLETED · M5 COMPLETED</div>\n<h1 class=\"hero\">运动达人</h1><p>你说想练什么，或者给一张动作照片。系统把需求、动作识别、关节结果和完整人体解剖放在同一个页面里。</p><div class=\"intent\"><input id=\"wish\" aria-label=\"我要练\" placeholder=\"例如：户外有单杠，想练背和手臂；或 15 分钟在家练全身\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"runWish\">给方案</button></div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip preset\" data-v=\"户外有单杠，想练背和手臂\">户外单杠</button><button class=\"chip preset\" data-v=\"15分钟在家练全身\">15分钟全身</button><button class=\"chip preset\" data-v=\"想练右手臂和二头肌\">右手臂</button></div><div id=\"wishResult\" class=\"result plan\">先输入一句“我要练……”。</div></section><div class=\"grid\"><section class=\"card\"><h2>动作识别｜真实照片 → 关节</h2><p>上传动作照片后，直接识别 33 个身体关键点，把骨架画回原图，并计算肘、髋、膝角度。</p><label class=\"upload\">选择动作照片<input class=\"hiddenInput\" id=\"poseFile\" type=\"file\" accept=\"image/*\"></label><button class=\"chip\" id=\"poseSample\" type=\"button\" disabled>运行真实俯卧撑样本</button><div id=\"poseStatus\" class=\"status\">正在准备姿态模型…</div><div id=\"poseStage\" class=\"poseStage\"><img id=\"poseImg\" alt=\"用户动作照片\"><canvas id=\"poseCanvas\"></canvas></div><div id=\"poseResult\" class=\"result plan\">等待照片。</div><div id=\"jointMap\" class=\"jointgrid\"></div><p class=\"status\">识别上游：MediaPipe Pose Landmarker Full。完整保留单图路径的 33 个二维关键点、33 个三维世界关键点、骨架连接、置信度与分割掩码；关节角度用于动作观察，不替代医疗诊断，也不冒充 OpenSim 生物力学结果。</p></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>同一人体坐标系</h2><p>照片关键点会映射到标准身体关节 ID；识别出的关节在这里形成统一结果，后续 OpenSim 与训练反馈复用同一组 ID。</p><div id=\"coordResult\" class=\"plan\">尚未收到动作照片。</div><h3>动作反馈</h3><div id=\"motionFeedback\" class=\"plan\">上传照片后生成基于关节角度的可检验描述，不凭照片猜伤病。</div><h3>当前验收边界</h3>\n<div class=\"gate ok\"><b>M3 COMPLETED｜2026-10-04。</b><br>真实图片已在本主页面完成 MediaPipe Pose Landmarker Full 推理：33 个二维关键点、33 个世界坐标关键点、分割掩膜与 6 个标准关节结果均回写统一人体坐标；自然语言路径同时通过。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/M3-completion-report-2026-10-04.md\">完成报告</a> · <a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m3/public-pose-verification.json\">公开验收证据</a>。</div>\n</section></div>\n<section class=\"card\" id=\"m4-biomechanics\"><div class=\"status\">M4｜COMPLETED｜2026-10-04｜真实 OpenSim Core 计算链</div><h2>真实肌骨 / 生物力学｜OpenSim Arm26</h2><p>不是读取 XML 或播放网页动画：以下数值由 OpenSim Core 4.6 实际加载成熟 Arm26 模型，设置 <code>r_elbow_flex</code> 坐标状态后，在 Position 阶段逐状态计算。</p><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"0\" disabled>肘屈 0°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"30\" disabled>30°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"60\" disabled>60°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"90\" disabled>90°</button><button class=\"chip\" data-m4-angle=\"120\" disabled>120°</button></div><p id=\"m4Status\" class=\"status\">正在读取 OpenSim Core 可复现计算产物…</p><div id=\"m4Result\" class=\"plan\">等待真实计算结果。</div><p id=\"m4Source\" class=\"status\">来源与单位将在产物校验后显示。</p><p class=\"status\">输出为模型状态相关的 muscle-tendon length 与 elbow moment arm；用于可复现的模型观察，不等同于个人医学诊断、实测肌力或训练处方。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/M4-completion-report-2026-10-04.md\">M4 完成报告</a> · <a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m4/public-opensim-verification.json\">公开验收证据</a>。</p></section>\n<section class=\"card\" id=\"biceps-dynamic-3d\"><div class=\"status\">SUB｜COMMON-HUMAN-COORDINATE / HUMAN-3D｜BICEPS-DYNAMIC-3D-V0.8</div><h2>同一真实右上肢 3D｜屈伸、前臂运动与肌肉形态</h2><p>右肩胛骨、肱骨、桡骨、尺骨、肱二头肌长头/短头共用一个 WebGL 视窗。桡尺骨作为同一刚性前臂组绕组内肘 pivot 屈伸；当前 CENTERED_LOCAL_WRAPPER 只能证明功能响应，尚不能证明肌肉近端/远端附着连续。</p><div id=\"realUpper3d\" style=\"height:520px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:#edf0ec;position:relative\"><div style=\"padding:14px\">正在加载 BodyParts3D 右上肢…</div></div><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip phasePreset\" data-phase=\"伸展\" data-elbow=\"0\" data-twist=\"0\">伸展</button><button class=\"chip phasePreset\" data-phase=\"屈曲中段\" data-elbow=\"60\" data-twist=\"30\">屈曲中段</button><button class=\"chip phasePreset\" data-phase=\"屈肘峰值\" data-elbow=\"120\" data-twist=\"55\">屈肘峰值</button><label class=\"chip\">屈肘 <input id=\"realElbowRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"120\" value=\"0\"></label><output id=\"realElbowOut\">0°</output><label class=\"chip\">前臂 <input id=\"realForearmRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"-80\" max=\"80\" value=\"0\"></label><output id=\"realForearmOut\">0°</output></div><div class=\"chips\"><label class=\"chip\">拖动观察角度 <input id=\"armViewRange\" type=\"range\" min=\"-60\" max=\"60\" value=\"0\" step=\"5\"></label><output id=\"armViewOut\">正面 0°</output><button class=\"chip\" id=\"bicepsReset\">回到伸展</button><span id=\"phaseName\" class=\"status\">阶段：伸展</span></div><p id=\"realAssetState\" class=\"status\">正在加载 6 件官方 OBJ…</p><div id=\"bicepsDynamicState\" class=\"plan\"><b>验收边界：</b>这是可观察的教学运动关系，不是关节面约束、真实力值、EMG 或 OpenSim 校准。</div><div id=\"anchorInvariant\" class=\"plan\" data-status=\"MEASURING\"><b>端点连续性仪表：</b>等待六件真实资产加载。</div><div class=\"gate\" id=\"bicepsVisualAudit\"><b>V0.7 视觉解剖审计：PUBLIC_VISUAL_GATE_FAILED。</b><br>真实 OBJ、视角变化和屈肘响应可见；但现有截图没有近端/远端肌肉锚点、端点距离不变量或新鲜页面版本证明，因此不能认证肌肉附着连续、关节面约束或碰撞安全。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m2/biceps-visual-anatomy-audit-v0.7.json\">审计证据</a>。</div></section><section class=\"card\"><h2>完整人体 / 解剖｜HUMAN-3D 能力块已验收</h2><p>完整 Human Atlas 保持在同一主入口：2,234 modeled pieces、3,432 FMA concepts、15 systems；可旋转、缩放、搜索、定位和按系统显示。M2 已按 Issue #2 独立通过公开 WebGL 验收。</p><iframe class=\"atlas\" title=\"完整人体解剖 Human Atlas\" src=\"anatomy/index.html\"></iframe><p class=\"status\">上游固定：ashemag/human-atlas；BodyParts3D 数据来源与许可信息保留在 anatomy/ATTRIBUTION.md。</p></section><section class=\"card\" id=\"m5-training-loop\"><div class=\"status\">M5｜COMPLETED｜2026-10-07｜训练反馈完整闭环</div><h2>训练闭环｜输入 → 解析 → 动作 → 解释 → 反馈 → 调整</h2><p id=\"m5EngineStatus\" class=\"status\">正在读取训练场景与安全分流规则…</p><div id=\"m5Parsed\" class=\"plan\">从页面顶部输入训练需求后，这里显示身体、目的、时间、环境、器械和限制的结构化解析。</div><div id=\"m5Actions\" class=\"m5-actions\"></div><div id=\"m5Session\" class=\"plan\">尚未生成训练会话。</div><div id=\"m5FeedbackPanel\" hidden><b>做完以后告诉我</b><div class=\"chips\"><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"轻松\">轻松</button><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"合适\">合适</button><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"偏吃力\">偏吃力</button><button class=\"chip feedback\" data-v=\"疼痛或麻木\">疼痛/麻木</button></div></div><div id=\"feedbackResult\" class=\"plan\">等待完整训练会话。</div><p class=\"status\">安全边界：疼痛、麻木、眩晕、胸闷、胸痛、呼吸困难或受伤优先进入安全分流，不生成冒进训练建议。本原型提供训练组织与反馈调整，不替代医疗诊断。</p><div class=\"gate ok\"><b>M5 COMPLETED｜2026-10-07。</b><br>两份独立上传图片均在公开页面完成 MediaPipe 33/33 姿态推理；当前姿态实际桥接 OpenSim 最近状态，户外单杠与 15 分钟家中全身分别完成反馈调整，异常信号进入安全分流。<a href=\"../docs/v0.1/M5-completion-report-2026-10-07.md\">完成报告</a> · <a href=\"../docs/v0.1/evidence/m5/public-training-loop-verification.json\">公开验收证据</a> · <a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/actions/runs/37606114771\">严格验收运行</a>。</div></section></main><script type=\"module\">try{const THREE=await import(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/+esm\");const{OrbitControls}=await import(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/examples/jsm/controls/OrbitControls.js/+esm\");const{OBJLoader}=await import(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.180.0/examples/jsm/loaders/OBJLoader.js/+esm\");const mount=document.getElementById(\"realUpper3d\"),state=document.getElementById(\"realAssetState\");const scene=new THREE.Scene();scene.background=new THREE.Color(0xedf0ec);const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(35,mount.clientWidth/520,.01,100);const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true});renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));renderer.setSize(mount.clientWidth,520);mount.innerHTML=\"\";mount.appendChild(renderer.domElement);const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);controls.enableDamping=true;scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x5f685f,2.4));const key=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,2.7);key.position.set(4,6,5);scene.add(key);const defs=[[\"FJ3384\",\"右肩胛骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3384.obj\",0xc8c0a9],[\"FJ3368\",\"右肱骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3368.obj\",0xd7cfb8],[\"FJ3349\",\"右桡骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3349.obj\",0xcfc7ae],[\"FJ3391\",\"右尺骨\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ3391.obj\",0xe1d9c2],[\"FJ1478\",\"右肱二头肌长头\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ1478.obj\",0xa75c59],[\"FJ1512\",\"右肱二头肌短头\",\"assets/bodyparts3d/FJ1512.obj\",0xc16f68]];const loader=new OBJLoader(),assetGroup=new THREE.Group(),objects=new Map();await Promise.all(defs.map(([id,label,url,color])=>loader.loadAsync(url).then(root=>{root.traverse(x=>{if(x.isMesh){x.geometry.computeVertexNormals();x.material=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color,roughness:.7});x.name=label+\"｜\"+id}});assetGroup.add(root);objects.set(id,root)})));assetGroup.updateMatrixWorld(true);function boundsLocal(root){assetGroup.updateMatrixWorld(true);const inv=assetGroup.matrixWorld.clone().invert(),out=new THREE.Box3().makeEmpty();root.updateMatrixWorld(true);root.traverse(x=>{if(!x.isMesh||!x.geometry)return;if(!x.geometry.boundingBox)x.geometry.computeBoundingBox();x.updateWorldMatrix(true,false);out.union(x.geometry.boundingBox.clone().applyMatrix4(inv.clone().multiply(x.matrixWorld)))});return out}function axis(box){const s=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());return s.x>=s.y&&s.x>=s.z?new THREE.Vector3(1,0,0):s.y>=s.z?new THREE.Vector3(0,1,0):new THREE.Vector3(0,0,1)}function endToward(box,a,target){const c=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),h=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()).multiplyScalar(.5),e=Math.abs(a.x)*h.x+Math.abs(a.y)*h.y+Math.abs(a.z)*h.z,p=c.clone().add(a.clone().multiplyScalar(e)),n=c.clone().add(a.clone().multiplyScalar(-e));return p.distanceToSquared(target)<n.distanceToSquared(target)?p:n}const scapula=objects.get(\"FJ3384\"),humerus=objects.get(\"FJ3368\"),forearm=[objects.get(\"FJ3349\"),objects.get(\"FJ3391\")],biceps=[objects.get(\"FJ1478\"),objects.get(\"FJ1512\")];const sb=boundsLocal(scapula),hb=boundsLocal(humerus),fb=new THREE.Box3().makeEmpty();forearm.forEach(o=>fb.union(boundsLocal(o)));const hc=hb.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),fc=fb.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),ha=axis(hb),fa=axis(fb);const pivot=endToward(hb,ha,fc).add(endToward(fb,fa,hc)).multiplyScalar(.5),long=fc.clone().sub(hc).normalize(),elbowAxis=Math.abs(long.z)<.85?new THREE.Vector3(0,0,1):new THREE.Vector3(1,0,0);const flex=new THREE.Group();flex.position.copy(pivot);assetGroup.add(flex);const twist=new THREE.Group();twist.position.copy(fc);assetGroup.add(twist);forearm.forEach(o=>twist.attach(o));flex.attach(twist);const baseFlex=flex.quaternion.clone(),baseTwist=twist.quaternion.clone();const muscles=biceps.map((root,index)=>{const b=boundsLocal(root),center=b.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),a=axis(b),half=b.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()).dot(new THREE.Vector3(Math.abs(a.x),Math.abs(a.y),Math.abs(a.z)))/2,p=center.clone().add(a.clone().multiplyScalar(half)),n=center.clone().add(a.clone().multiplyScalar(-half)),wrap=new THREE.Group();wrap.position.copy(center);assetGroup.add(wrap);wrap.attach(root);wrap.updateMatrixWorld(true);const pLocal=wrap.worldToLocal(p.clone()),nLocal=wrap.worldToLocal(n.clone());return{root,wrap,a,base:wrap.scale.clone(),pLocal,nLocal,label:index===0?\"长头\":\"短头\"}});const whole=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(assetGroup),size=whole.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()),center=whole.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),scale=4.2/Math.max(size.x,size.y,size.z),normalized=new THREE.Group();assetGroup.position.copy(center).multiplyScalar(-1);normalized.add(assetGroup);normalized.scale.setScalar(scale);scene.add(normalized);camera.position.set(4.8,2.4,6.8);controls.target.set(0,0,0);controls.update();mount.dataset.kinematicModel=\"GROUP_LOCAL_PIVOT_V0.8\";mount.dataset.muscleModel=\"CENTERED_LOCAL_WRAPPER_WITH_ENDPOINT_INSTRUMENT\";state.dataset.status=\"DISPLAYED\";state.textContent=\"已加载 6/6 件官方 OBJ（新增右肩胛骨 FJ3384）；桡尺骨同组，局部肘 pivot 与端点仪表已启用。\";const invariant=document.getElementById(\"anchorInvariant\"),markers=muscles.flatMap(()=>[new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(.035,16,12),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0x2c7a55})),new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.SphereGeometry(.035,16,12),new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:0xa15d45}))]);markers.forEach(m=>scene.add(m));function pose(deg,rot){flex.quaternion.copy(baseFlex).multiply(new THREE.Quaternion().setFromAxisAngle(elbowAxis,-THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(deg)));twist.quaternion.copy(baseTwist).multiply(new THREE.Quaternion().setFromAxisAngle(fa,THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(rot)));const t=Math.max(0,Math.min(1,deg/120)),sh=1-.08*t,bu=1+.12*t;muscles.forEach(({wrap,a,base})=>wrap.scale.set(base.x*(a.x?sh:bu),base.y*(a.y?sh:bu),base.z*(a.z?sh:bu)));assetGroup.updateMatrixWorld(true);const scapulaBox=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(scapula),radiusBox=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(objects.get(\"FJ3349\"));const rows=muscles.map((m,i)=>{const p=m.wrap.localToWorld(m.pLocal.clone()),n=m.wrap.localToWorld(m.nLocal.clone()),prox=scapulaBox.distanceToPoint(p)<=scapulaBox.distanceToPoint(n)?p:n,dist=prox===p?n:p,pg=scapulaBox.distanceToPoint(prox),dg=radiusBox.distanceToPoint(dist);markers[i*2].position.copy(prox);markers[i*2+1].position.copy(dist);return`${m.label} 近端间隙 ${pg.toFixed(3)} / 远端间隙 ${dg.toFixed(3)}`});invariant.dataset.status=\"MEASURED_PROXY_NOT_CERTIFIED\";invariant.innerHTML=\"<b>端点连续性仪表：</b>\"+rows.join(\"；\")+\"。绿色/棕色球分别跟踪近端/远端几何端点；间隙是模型单位下的包围盒距离，仅用于暴露断裂，不等于解剖附着认证。\";realElbowRange.value=String(Math.round(deg));realForearmRange.value=String(Math.round(rot));realElbowOut.textContent=Math.round(deg)+\"°\";realForearmOut.textContent=(rot>0?\"+\":\"\")+Math.round(rot)+\"°\";bicepsDynamicState.innerHTML=\"<b>BICEPS-DYNAMIC-3D-V0.6：</b>桡尺骨围绕同一组内肘 pivot 屈伸；肌肉围绕自身中心作 8% 缩短/12% 增厚教学形变。仍未认证关节面约束或真实力值。\"}const er=document.getElementById(\"realElbowRange\"),frange=document.getElementById(\"realForearmRange\");er.oninput=()=>pose(+er.value,+frange.value);frange.oninput=()=>pose(+er.value,+frange.value);document.querySelectorAll(\".phasePreset\").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{pose(+b.dataset.elbow,+b.dataset.twist);phaseName.textContent=\"阶段：\"+b.dataset.phase;document.querySelector(\"#biceps-dynamic-3d\").dataset.phase=b.dataset.phase});bicepsReset.onclick=()=>{pose(0,0);phaseName.textContent=\"阶段：伸展\"};function setView(a){const r=7,target=controls.target;camera.position.set(target.x+Math.sin(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(a))*r,target.y+1.6,target.z+Math.cos(THREE.MathUtils.degToRad(a))*r);camera.lookAt(target);controls.update();armViewRange.value=String(a);armViewOut.textContent=a===0?\"正面 0°\":(a>0?\"右前斜视 +\":\"左前斜视 \")+a+\"°\";armViewOut.dataset.viewMode=\"REAL_OBJ_ORBIT\";armViewOut.dataset.viewAngle=String(a)}armViewRange.oninput=()=>setView(+armViewRange.value);pose(0,0);setView(0);addEventListener(\"resize\",()=>{camera.aspect=mount.clientWidth/520;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();renderer.setSize(mount.clientWidth,520)});(function loop(){requestAnimationFrame(loop);controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera)})();}catch(e){c