aCVu2wiSg1Mr0347","is_error":false,"content":"# zero-one-workbench\n零一空间研究工作台\n# Generated A01 deployment assets (built from pinned, checksum-verified upstreams).\nportal/vendor/mediapipe/vision_bundle.mjs\nportal/vendor/mediapipe/wasm/\nportal/vendor/mediapipe/models/\n====\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>零一空间｜产品入口</title><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"assets/style.css\"><style>\nbody{background:#f5f7f5;color:#1c3028}main.wrap{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h1{margin-bottom:8px}.intro{color:#52635a;margin-bottom:25px}.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(265px,1fr));gap:16px}.product{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce6df;border-radius:15px;padding:22px}.product h2{margin:0 0 8px}.product p{line-height:1.65}.product a{display:inline-block;margin-top:8px;font-weight:650}.status{font-size:.85rem;color:#735b30}.note{margin-top:26px;color:#52635a;font-size:.95rem}.links{margin-top:22px;display:flex;gap:15px;flex-wrap:wrap}.links a{font-size:.92rem}\n</style></head>\n<body><main class=\"wrap\">\n<h1>零一空间</h1><p class=\"intro\">从这里进入产品。保留完整目标，优先接入成熟能力，以实际使用和验证结果为准。</p>\n<p><a href=\"tech-delivery-board.html\"><strong>查看「陪你读书」与「动起来」技术方案、执行进程和验收状态 →</strong></a></p>\\n<div class=\"products\">\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>动起来 · 运动达人</h2><p>完整人体与动作、真实动态教学、训练跟练、记录和反馈；面向不同年龄、场地和身体条件。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：MediaPipe 运行时与姿态模型已改为本站同源部署；真实设备跟练和用户验收仍待完成。</p><a href=\"movement-mediapipe.html\">打开摄像头跟练原型 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>算命先生 · 天机完整原版</h2><p>完整复用 MIT 开源的“天机”Web 产品，保留原版八字、六爻、紫微斗数、中英双语、主题切换与分享功能；所有计算在浏览器本机完成。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：天机完整原版已合并至主分支，可作为局部试用入口；算命先生要求的其他成熟系统尚未完整接入，整体产品未验收。</p><a href=\"fortune-teller/index.html\">打开算命先生 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>零一空间研究 · 陪你读书</h2><p>整书阅读与聆听、目录、进度、笔记交流、背景音及经授权的个性化声音。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：已接入 Foliate 整书阅读器与封面书架，支持本地导入、目录、连续朗读和背景音；个性化声音训练与用户验收尚未完成。</p><a href=\"reader-integrated.html\">打开陪你读书 →</a> · <a href=\"reader-progress.html\">查看任务明细与进程 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>听世界 · 网络电台</h2><p>选择音乐和广播频道，边听边做自己的事。</p><a href=\"classical-radio.html\">打开听世界 →</a></article>\n<article class=\"product\"><h2>看世界 · 直播频道</h2><p>世界直播、城市、自然、太空、音乐与文化视频。</p><p class=\"status\">当前：直播目录已有经媒体探测的频道；浏览器实际播放与公开交付仍待验证。</p><a href=\"watch-world.html\">查看看世界 →</a></article>\n</div>\n<p class=\"note\"><strong>统一试用与反馈：</strong>各入口均可直接打开；页面可访问不代表功能已通过实测。请记录具体操作、错误原文及浏览器环境，反馈后修复并重新发布。<br><strong>交付标准：</strong>可实际操作、成熟组件真实运行、许可可核查、部署可访问、测试可复现。试用发布与最终用户验收分别记录。未完成的功能不写成已上线。</p>\n<nav class=\"links\" aria-label=\"工程资料\"><a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/issues/24\">原施工单</a><a href=\"https://github.com/foxlongfei/zero-one-workbench/actions\">自动化记录</a><a href=\"v02-control.html\">历史施工记录</a><a href=\"engineering-console.html\">工程日志</a></nav>\n</main></body></html>\n====\nartifacts/dq-movement:\nd\n\nartifacts/dq-movement/d:\n====\n{\n  \"updated\": \"2026-09-27 14:50 UTC+08:00\",\n  \"policy\": \"Drive authoritative -> Drive readback -> GitHub CURRENT sync -> GitHub readback\",\n  \"projects\": {\n    \"research\": {\n      \"name\": \"零一空间研究\",\n      \"closed_mainline\": {\n        \"id\": \"Z01-Z04\",\n        \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n        \"passed\": 4,\n        \"total\": 4\n      },\n      \"current_mainline\": {\n        \"id\": \"K02-03\",\n        \"title\": \"术数/方技案例的可验证性与失效机制\",\n        \"status\": \"ACTIVE\",\n        \"passed\": 0,\n        \"total\": 5,\n        \"published_at\": \"2026-09-27 14:48 UTC+08:00\",\n        \"cases\": [\n          \"贺良\",\n          \"少翁\",\n          \"栾大\",\n          \"尹敏\",\n          \"任文公\"\n        ],\n        \"next\": \"贺良原典定位与五维试填\"\n      },\n      \"active_sublines\": [\n        \"TEMP-E01\",\n        \"TEMP-M01\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"movement\": {\n      \"name\": \"动起来\",\n      \"mainline\": {\n        \"status\": \"IN_PROGRESS\",\n        \"passed\": 1,\n        \"total\": 4\n      },\n      \"M01\": {\n        \"status\": \"COMPLETED\",\n        \"evidence\": \"9/9 SHA-256; 5/5 ZIP; 112/112 members audited\"\n      },\n      \"M02\": {\n        \"status\": \"PAUSED_PENDING_C_ACCEPTANCE\",\n        \"last_substantive_action\": \"2026-09-27 13:36 UTC+08:00\",\n        \"evidence\": \"Q clean-blind first pass submitted\"\n      },\n      \"M03\": {\n        \"status\": \"BLOCKED_CLEAN_CONTEXT\",\n        \"reason\": \"current context has seen Q summary\"\n      },\n      \"M04\": {\n        \"status\": \"BLOCKED_BY_M03_AND_C_ACCEPTANCE\",\n        \"results\": \"not formed\"\n      },\n      \"coordinate_system\": \"ACTIVE; complete biceps-elbow-forearm sample not field-calibrated\",\n      \"youth\": \"ACTIVE_V0.1_ARTIFACT_EXISTS\",\n      \"community_grading\": \"RESTART_NOW\"\n    },\n    \"food\": {\n      \"name\": \"食色性也\",\n      \"status\": \"PAUSED\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n====\n# V0.2 总收束施工单｜2026-10-13\n\n## 本轮决定：只重排呈现与交付顺序，不删既有研究、任务或证据\nA01 以完整人的训练旅程为入口；B01 以「先生接案」为入口，住宅风水仅是一个业务场景；C01 以选书→听读→互动→续读为入口。成熟技术为能力层，不能取代整体产品。\n\n## 冻结和归档\n- 保留 #3 A01–A04、B01–B04 的历史任务编号与全部成果；此前把 B01–B04 全部限定住宅的描述视为**子模块施工单**，不是整个《堪舆先生》的产品边界。\n- PR #9、#14 保持 Draft；冲突必须审查，禁止强制合并覆盖 main。\n- 现有三页整体体验：`portal/movement-v02-experience.html`、`portal/housing-v02-experience.html`、`portal/read-with-you-v01.html` 为已提交代码，非完整原型验收。B01住宅页仅是「住宅专题」，不是《堪舆先生》整体入口。\n- 暂停独立的肌肉/骨骼微细化、二维画面美化、单一风水规则精修等非阻塞事项；标记 DEFERRED，保留编号与证据，不删除。\n\n## 统一施工优先序（先组装，后精修）\n### P0｜用户可见的整体场景\n**A01 运动达人：** 选择目标/身体条件/环境 → 选择全身训练计划 → 连续教学示范与跟练 → 训练记录 → 可选视频对照 → 反馈/下一次计划。真实人体与完整动作优先于孤立肢体；已有MediaPipe/OpenSim/wger证据作为可替换能力，不冒充已集成。\n**B01 堪舆先生：** 先生接案首页 → 问题分类（失物、吉凶、前程、婚姻、求子、择日、住宅等）→ 选择传统方法及输入所需资料 → 演算/来源解释 → 追问与保存案例。住宅平面图/环境计算属于「住宅专题」。没有可验证依据的预测必须显式标为传统解释、未证实；涉及生育、健康、财产不代替专业意见。\n**C01 陪你读书：** 作品/段落选择 → 可听朗读 → 儿童/老人模式 → 进度/音频研究。原工单 #10–#15 不变。\n\n### P1｜独立测试与双盲验证\n1. 发布前：静态测试、真实浏览器、手机基本交互、公开HTTPS读回；至少一名未参与实现的验收者测试。\n2. 预先冻结用户任务和通过标准；测试者不看实现提示，开发者不得根据测试中答案即时改动评分规则。\n3. 对教学体验采用任务盲测（能否独立完成场景）；对传统预测声称的准确性采用预测者与评分者信息隔离、预注册样本/基线/失败记录，不能用几例演示证明预测有效。\n4. 不适用双盲的工程测试标注为独立功能测试，不虚称双盲。\n\n### P2｜阶段验收门\nG0 旧任务/资料核对 → G1 整体流程可操作 → G2 成熟能力真实接入或明确占位 → G3 独立测试 → G4 CI/PR审查 → G5 主分支Pages发布并外部读回 → G6 用户体验反馈与台账归档。任何一门未过不得 ACCEPTED。\n\n## 最近三个可交付增量（禁止无限扩张）\n1. **B-ENTRY：** 先把《堪舆先生》总入口从「住宅」纠偏为多类接案、案例保存、传统方法选择；保留住宅子模块链接。验收：至少「失物」「住宅」两个不同问题走通同一Case流程，未实现方法明示不可用，不编造预测。\n2. **A-TEACH：** 把运动整体跟练页升级为真实教学资源/连续动作示范的体验，明确来源许可；验收：至少两个不同全身动作可跟学并保存训练记录。\n3. **C-READ：** 修复真实朗读/文本版本/进度的用户体验，按 #10–#15 验收，禁止用任务分派代替执行。\n\n## 执行台账（建立时）\nA体验页代码已提交 `ed467eb`，B住宅专题页代码已提交 `75b9c45`，C朗读页主分支提交 `234fe1d`，统一入口提交 `e725629`。尚无本轮真实双盲记录、完整先生接案页、真实外部读回或用户验收。状态 IN_PROGRESS / NOT_ACCEPTED。\n\n下一轮必须以「已部署可操作URL + 实测证据 + 未通过项」交付，不得再用局部研究报告代替产品进度。"}]}},{"type":"user","uuid":"f74216da-67e0-477a-9a7d-940c48177584","session_id":"eb902ebe-bf82-46d6-8e5c-a035c59e1ff7","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call_01_mBTCF5fGaVYNuOyJQhhT7193","is_error":false,"content":"a01-pr28-regression.yml\nb01-lunar-browser.yml\nc01-reader-integration.yml\nd-reader-autonomous.yml\nd-reader-handoff.yml\nd-reader-independent.yml\ndeepseek-smoke.yml\ndepthmap-prototype.yml\ndq-movement-independent.yml\nmovement-v02-upstream.yml\nportal-delivery.yml\npublish-radio-pages.yml\nqwen-connection-smoke.yml\nrun-k5-advisor.yml\nrun-opensim-m4.yml\nrun-radiance-k3.yml\nthree-doctor-trial.yml\nv02-aider-a01-pilot.yml\nv02-aider-deepseek-a01.yml\nv02-aider-deepseek-b01-round2.yml\nv02-autonomous-developer.yml\nv02-dual-agent-mainline.yml\nv02-dual-track.yml\nv02-pr-browser.yml\nv02-prototype-pipeline.yml\nvendor-human-atlas.yml\nverify-k4-evidence.yml\nverify-public-anatomy.yml\nverify-public-k3.yml\nverify-public-k4.yml\nverify-public-k5.yml\nverify-public-m3.yml\nverify-public-m4.yml\nverify-public-m5.yml\nverify-public-z05-b.yml\nverify-v01-public.yml\nwatch-world-quality.yml\n====\n==> .github/workflows/a01-pr28-regression.yml <==\nname: A01 PR28 pose-start regression\n\non:\n  pull_request:\n    paths:\n      - \"portal/movement-mediapipe.html\"\n      - \"portal/movement-mediapipe-v2.html\"\n      - \"portal/index.html\"\n      - \"portal/vendor/mediapipe/**\"\n      - \"scripts/prepare-a01-mediapipe-vendor.sh\"\n      - \"tests/v02/a01-mediapipe-smoke.cjs\"\n      - \".github/workflows/a01-pr28-regression.yml\"\n  push:\n    branches:\n      - integration/a01-mediapipe-20261014\n    paths:\n      - \"portal/movement-mediapipe.html\"\n      - \"portal/movement-mediapipe-v2.html\"\n      - \"portal/index.html\"\n      - \"tests/v02/a01-mediapipe-smoke.cjs\"\n      - \".github/workflows/a01-pr28-regression.yml\"\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n\nconcurrency:\n  group: a01-pr28-regression\n  cancel-in-progress: true\n\njobs:\n  browser-regression:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 15\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: \"22\"\n      - name: Validate product and test syntax\n        run: |\n          node --check tests/v02/a01-mediapipe-smoke.cjs\n          python3 tests/v02/check_prototypes.py --project A01\n      - name: Install pinned browser\n        run: |\n          npm install --no-save --package-lock=false playwright@1.56.1\n          npx playwright install --with-deps chromium\n      - name: Build pinned same-origin MediaPipe runtime\n        run: bash scripts/prepare-a01-mediapipe-vendor.sh portal\n      - name: Run A01 pose-start browser regression\n        run: node tests/v02/a01-mediapipe-smoke.cjs\n      - name: Upload A01 regression evidence\n        if: always()\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: a01-pr28-pose-start\n          path: reports/v02/\n          if-no-files-found: error\n\n==> .github/workflows/b01-lunar-browser.yml <==\nname: B01 lunar engine browser verification\n\non:\n  pull_request:\n    branches: [main]\n    paths:\n      - \"portal/traditional-lunar-engine.html\"\n      - \"portal/assets/b01-lunar-case.js\"\n      - \"portal/vendor/lunar-javascript/**\"\n      - \"scripts/b01-lunar-browser-verify.cjs\"\n      - \"scripts/b01-lunar-unit-verify.cjs\"\n      - \".github/workflows/b01-lunar-browser.yml\"\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n\nconcurrency:\n  group: b01-lunar-${{ github.event.pull_request.number || github.ref }}\n  cancel-in-progress: true\n\njobs:\n  verify-browser:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 20\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: 22\n      - name: Validate product JavaScript syntax\n        run: node --check portal/assets/b01-lunar-case.js && node --check scripts/b01-lunar-browser-verify.cjs && node --check scripts/b01-lunar-unit-verify.cjs\n      - name: Run deterministic date and repeat regressions\n        env:\n          TZ: America/New_York\n        run: node scripts/b01-lunar-unit-verify.cjs\n      - name: Install pinned browser verifier\n        run: |\n          npm install --no-save --no-package-lock playwright@1.55.0\n          npx playwright install chromium --with-deps\n      - name: Start branch web server\n        run: |\n          python3 -m http.server 4173 >/tmp/b01-http.log 2>&1 &\n          for attempt in {1..20}; do\n            curl --fail --silent http://127.0.0.1:4173/portal/traditional-lunar-engine.html >/dev/null && exit 0\n            sleep 1\n          done\n          cat /tmp/b01-http.log\n          exit 1\n      - name: Run lost-item flow against complete engine\n        env:\n          B01_BASE_URL: http://127.0.0.1:4173\n        run: node scripts/b01-lunar-browser-verify.cjs\n      - name: Upload reproducible evidence\n        if: always()\n        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        with:\n          name: b01-lunar-${{ github.sha }}\n          path: artifacts/b01-lunar/\n          if-no-files-found: error\n\n==> .github/workflows/c01-reader-integration.yml <==\nname: C01 real book browser integration\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [c01-foliate-reader-integration]\n    paths:\n      - 'portal/read-with-you-v01.html'\n      - 'portal/reader-integrated.js'\n      - 'portal/vendor/foliate-js/**'\n      - 'tests/c01-reader/**'\n      - '.github/workflows/c01-reader-integration.yml'\n  workflow_dispatch:\njobs:\n  real-books:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    timeout-minutes: 20\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4\n        with:\n          node-version: '22'\n      - run: npm install --no-save playwright@1.56.1\n      - run: npx playwright install --with-deps chromium\n      - run: python3 tests/c01-reader/make-books.py\n      - name: Browser import TOC text speech resume\n        run: node tests/c01-reader/check.mjs\n      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        if: always()\n        with:\n          name: c01-browser-evidence\n          path: tests/c01-reader/evidence/\n\n==> .github/workflows/d-reader-autonomous.yml <==\nname: D博士 C01 autonomous prototype delivery\n# Execution requested 2026-10-23: build, test, and submit deliverable\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    paths:\n      - '.github/workflows/d-reader-autonomous.yml'\n  schedule:\n    - cron: '23 3 * * *'\npermissions:\n  contents: write\n  pull-requests: write\n  issues: write\njobs:\n  deepseek-build:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04\n    timeout-minutes: 30\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          persist-credentials: true\n      - name: Ask D博士 to own implementation and write files\n        env:\n          DEEPSEEK_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.DEEPSEEK_API_KEY }}\n          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n        run: |\n          mkdir -p artifacts/d-reader\n          python3 - <<'PY'\n          import json,os,pathlib,urllib.request,urllib.error,subprocess,time,traceback\n          out=pathlib.Path('artifacts/d-reader');out.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\n          key=os.environ.get('DEEPSEEK_API_KEY')\n          if not key: raise SystemExit('Missing DEEPSEEK_API_KEY')\n          paths=['handoffs/C01-DEEPSEEK-OWNER.md','portal/reader-integrated.html','portal/reader-integrated.js','tests/c01-reader/check.mjs']\n          sources=[]\n          for p in paths:\n           f=pathlib.Path(p)\n           if f.exists(): sources.append({'path':p,'content':f.read_text(encoding='utf-8')[:12000]})\n          issue=subprocess.run(['gh','issue','view','42','--json','body,comments'],capture_output=True,text=True,check=True)\n          context={'sources':sources,'issue42':json.loads(issue.stdout)}\n          system='''你是D博士，C01陪你读书的唯一技术选型和产品实现负责人。你可自主推翻原技术架构和选用任何许可允许的成熟开源实现；现有文件只是参考。每次只提交一个小而有效的修复或功能模块。为防模型输出截断，禁止返回整个超长文件，优先新建一个独立的短模块，或对现有文件提供少量精确文本替换。仅返回严格JSON，结构为 {\"decision\":\"技术选择与依据\",\"edits\":[{\"path\":\"portal/reader-integrated.js\",\"find\":\"要精确匹配的一小段现有文本\",\"replace\":\"替换文本\"}],\"new_files\":[{\"path\":\"portal/new-module.js\",\"content\":\"文件内容\"}],\"limitations\":\"...\"}。单次输出不超过约10000字符，替换find必须存在并且只出现一次；新建文件必须不存在。不得修改密钥、工作流或CI，禁止任何未经用户授权的语音克隆。请用真实可运行代码交付而不是空建议。'''\n          answer=None\n          for attempt in range(1,5):\n           try:\n            extra='前一次输出不完整或不可解析，请只输出更小的单个可执行改动，控制在6000字符内。' if attempt>1 else ''\n            data=json.dumps({'model':'deepseek-chat','messages':[{'role':'system','content':system},{'role':'user','content':json.dumps(context,ensure_ascii=False)+'\\n'+extra}],'response_format':{'type':'json_object'},'max_tokens':8192,'stream':False}).encode()\n            request=urllib.request.Request('https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions',data=data,headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+key,'Content-Type':'application/json'})\n            with urllib.request.urlopen(request,timeout=180) as response: result=json.load(response)\n            message=result['choices'][0]['message']\n            raw=message.get('content') or ''\n            (out/('attempt-'+str(attempt)+'.json')).write_text(json.dumps({'answer':raw,'finish_reason':result['choices'][0].get('finish_reason'),'usage':result.get('usage',{})},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),encoding='utf-8')\n            if result['choices'][0].get('finish_reason')=='length':raise ValueError('Model truncated response')\n            answer=json.loads(raw)\n            if not isinstance(answer.get('edits',[]),list) or not isinstance(answer.get('new_files',[]),list):raise ValueError('Invalid edits/new_files')\n            break\n           except Exception as e:\n            (out/('error-'+str(attempt)+'.txt')).write_text(str(e),encoding='utf-8')\n            print('Attempt',attempt,'failed:',str(e))\n            if attempt==4:raise\n            time.sleep(attempt*2)\n          changed=[]\n          def checkpath(p):\n           path=pathlib.PurePosixPath(p)\n           if path.is_absolute() or '..' in path.parts or not (p.startswith('portal/') or p.startswith('tests/c01-reader/')):raise ValueError('Unsafe path: '+p)\n           if not p.endswith(('.js','.mjs','.html','.css','.json')):raise ValueError('Unsupported extension: '+p)\n           return pathlib.Path(p)\n          for item in answer.get('edits',[]):\n           f=checkpath(item['path']);before=f.read_text(encoding='utf-8')\n           needle=item.get('find','')\n           if not needle or before.count(needle)!=1:raise ValueError('Non-unique or missing anchor: '+str(f))\n           f.write_text(before.replace(needle,item['replace'],1),encoding='utf-8');changed.append(str(f))\n          for item in answer.get('new_files',[]):\n           f=checkpath(item['path'])\n           if f.exists():raise ValueError('Refuse overwrite existing file: '+str(f))\n           f.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);f.write_text(item['content'],encoding='utf-8');changed.append(str(f))\n          (out/'decision.json').write_text(json.dumps({'decision':answer.get('decision'),'limitations':answer.get('limitations'),'changed':changed},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),encoding='utf-8')\n          if not changed:raise SystemExit('D博士没有提供可执行改动')\n          print('D博士修改文件:',changed)\n          \n          PY\n      - name: Install C01 browser test dependencies\n\n==> .github/workflows/d-reader-handoff.yml <==\nname: D博士 C01 reader execution handoff\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    paths:\n      - '.github/workflows/d-reader-handoff.yml'\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  issues: write\njobs:\n  deepseek-handoff:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-24.04\n    timeout-minutes: 10\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - name: Request D博士 implementation review and executable patch\n        env:\n          DEEPSEEK_API_KEY: ${{ secrets.DEEPSEEK_API_KEY }}\n          GH_TOKEN: ${{ github.token }}\n        run: |\n          python3 - <<'PY'\n          import os,json,urllib.request,pathlib,subprocess\n          key=os.environ.get('DEEPSEEK_API_KEY')\n          if not key: raise SystemExit('DEEPSEEK_API_KEY is not configured')\n          paths=['portal/reader-integrated.html','portal/reader-integrated.js','tests/c01-reader/check.mjs']\n          sources=[]\n          for name in paths:\n              p=pathlib.Path(name)\n              if p.exists(): sources.append({'path':name,'content':p.read_text(encoding='utf8')[:26000]})\n          task='''你是D博士，C01陪你读书项目的主责开发与验收者。用户已将实现工作移交给你。阅读给定现有代码，提出**可直接应用的真实 unified diff patch**，不要泛泛建议，不要删减功能。优先修复一项有证据的实际缺陷。回复严格JSON: {\"summary\":\"...\",\"patch\":\"...\",\"tests\":[\"...\"],\"risks\":[\"...\"]}。补丁必须有标准---/+++文件头、@@行号；若信息不足，patch为空并说明。你目前仅能提出补丁，不能声称已经部署或验收。'''\n          data=json.dumps({'model':'deepseek-chat','messages':[{'role':'system','content':task},{'role':'user','content':json.dumps({'issue':42,'sources':sources},ensure_ascii=False)}],'max_tokens':6500,'stream':False}).encode()\n          req=urllib.request.Request('https://api.deepseek.com/chat/completions',data=data,headers={'Authorization':'Bearer '+key,'Content-Type':'application/json'},method='POST')\n          with urllib.request.urlopen(req,timeout=150) as response: result=json.load(response)\n          answer=result['choices'][0]['message'].get('content','')\n          pathlib.Path('artifacts/d-reader').mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)\n          pathlib.Path('artifacts/d-reader/response.json').write_text(json.dumps({'model':result.get('model'),'answer':answer,'usage':result.get('usage',{})},ensure_ascii=False,indent=2),encoding='utf8')\n          print('DeepSeek returned',len(answer),'characters; artifact saved')\n          # Publish evidence to the original issue, not a completion claim.\n          body='D博士API调用已返回。完整原始回答见本次GitHub Actions artifact。此步骤尚未自动应用补丁、部署或验收。\\\\n\\\\nRun: '+os.environ['GITHUB_SERVER_URL']+'/'+os.environ['GITHUB_REPOSITORY']+'/actions/runs/'+os.environ['GITHUB_RUN_ID']\n          subprocess.run(['gh','issue','comment','42','--body',body],check=True)\n          PY\n      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4\n        if: always()\n        with:\n          name: d-reader-response\n          path: artifacts/d-reader/\n          retention-days: 30\n\n==> .github/workflows/d-reader-independent.yml <==\nname: D博士 independent Read With You delivery\n\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    paths:\n      - '.github/workflows/d-reader-independent.yml'\n  schedule:\n    - cron: '23 3 * * *'\n\npermissions:\n  contents: write\n  pull-requests: write\n  issues: write"}]}},{"type":"assistant","uuid":"de1ebd22-adfe-4b2c-bc2d-ed8d637305ab","session_id":"eb902ebe-bf82-46d6-8e5c-a035c59e1ff7","parent_tool_use_id":null,"message":{"id":"de1ebd22-adfe-4b2c-bc2d-ed8d637305ab","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-chat","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_BMtJ0KdUEsMvDWSr7GK39048","name":"run_shell_command","input":{"command":"cd /home/runner/work/zero-one-workbench/zero-one-workbench && cat .github/workflows/dq-movement-independent.yml && echo ===== && cat .github/workflows/portal-delivery.yml","description":